---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service" description="yaopulife Terms of Service — terms for using our Chinese culture stories, content and resources.">
  <Navbar />

  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-gray-500">Last updated: June 27, 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-12 prose prose-lg text-gray-600">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing and using yaopulife.com, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">2. What yaopulife Is</h2>
        <p>yaopulife (耀蒲) is a content publication that retells Chinese myths, festivals, zodiac lore and related culture for a global audience. Articles and stories on this site are provided for general reading, education and entertainment.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">3. Content &amp; Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>Our stories are original retellings of public-domain Chinese classics, together with original writing and artwork created by yaopulife. You may read and share links freely. You may not republish, resell or redistribute our writing or artwork without permission. Any downloadable resources (such as printable packs) are licensed for personal or classroom use unless stated otherwise.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">4. Submissions</h2>
        <p>If you contact us or send suggestions, you grant us permission to read and respond to your message. Do not send confidential information. We handle the details you submit in line with our <a href="/privacy" class="text-brand-600">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">5. Accuracy &amp; Cultural Interpretation</h2>
        <p>Myths exist in many versions. We aim to keep the core spirit of each story accurate while making it accessible; our retellings are interpretations, not academic or religious authority.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, yaopulife is not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages related to use of the site or its content.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">7. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms? Contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@yaopulife.com" class="text-brand-600">hello@yaopulife.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
